bout X in input_text. If yes, add one bullet to summary for X, copying the exact Spanish span(s) from input_text about X (no paraphrasing; preserve modality).\', \'For each key X in relevant_context, write one short Spanish sentence summarizing that information for X and store it in summary_by_item[X].\', \'Extractive summary in Spanish: copy exact spans; DO NOT paraphrase; preserve modality ("soñaba ser", "quería ser", "aspiraba a").\', \'If no relevant info, set info_found="FALSE", relevant_context=[], summary_by_item={}, summary="".\', \'NO APOLOGIES, NO FILLER TEXT\']}'
